    \item Coulomb-barrier modulation for $Z=76$--$92$
    \item Flux--velocity coupling terms $(v_{Pt}, v_{nu})$
\end{itemize}
\textbf{Output:} Stability gradient field $\nabla \Phi$.

\subsection*{2.4 Entropy Engine}
Fusion energy spikes $E_{spike}$ are converted into entropy:
\begin{equation}
    S_{entropy} = h(E_{spike})
\end{equation}
\textbf{Function:} Reinforce and deepen the forward portion of the stability well.

\subsection*{2.5 Propulsion Drive}
Effective drift velocity is modeled as:
\begin{equation}
    v \propto k \cdot \left|\nabla \Phi\right| \cdot S_{entropy}
\end{equation}
where $k$ is a coupling coefficient dependent on craft mass, geometry, and anchor coherence.

\subsection*{2.6 Ledger Module}
\textbf{Function:} Record $\Phi_{ext}(t)$, $\Phi_{int}(t)$, $\nabla \Phi(t)$, 
$S_{entropy}(t)$, and resulting drift vectors in encrypted form.

